WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.334
ImpactMEL includes AI that works from your organisation's own records.

2
00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:11.171
Nothing it drafts is saved until you choose to keep it.

3
00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:15.119
Nadia needs a form for savings group meetings.

4
00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:19.819
Instead of building it question by question, she describes it in plain words.

5
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.021
A few seconds later she has the questions, the answer types, and the skip logic.

6
00:00:26.021 --> 00:00:29.350
The loan questions only appear when loans were issued.

7
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.612
She checks it, names it, and creates the form.

8
00:00:34.473 --> 00:00:36.118
Changes work the same way.

9
00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:40.169
She asks for one more question, sees the result, and applies it.

10
00:00:48.401 --> 00:00:52.741
For a new project, she starts from the proposal the donor approved.

11
00:00:52.741 --> 00:00:56.110
ImpactMEL reads it and drafts the results framework.

12
00:00:56.556 --> 00:01:01.569
Every outcome, output and indicator shows the page and the words it came from.

13
00:01:01.569 --> 00:01:06.260
Anything the proposal does not say comes back as a question for her team,

14
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.931
never as a made-up number.

15
00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:29.518
She can add it to the project in one step.

16
00:01:29.518 --> 00:01:32.916
For now she closes it, and moves on to the review queue.

17
00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:36.634
This figure is far below the last three quarters.

18
00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:39.051
ImpactMEL flags it with the numbers,

19
00:01:39.051 --> 00:01:43.013
and the AI explains what might be going on and what to ask.

20
00:01:43.013 --> 00:01:45.297
It never approves anything itself.

21
00:01:45.741 --> 00:01:49.373
At the end of the quarter, the donor report needs a narrative.

22
00:01:49.373 --> 00:01:54.176
The AI writes it only from approved figures, and checks every number against them.

23
00:01:54.904 --> 00:01:59.607
Where the figures cannot explain a result, it asks her team instead of guessing.

24
00:02:00.042 --> 00:02:05.477
Administrators can switch AI on or off for their organisation in Workspace settings.

25
00:02:05.477 --> 00:02:07.807
Every decision stays with your team.
